# 🧠 CompetencyIQ

## AI-Powered Competency Assessment, Skill-Gap Analysis & Personalized Learning Platform

CompetencyIQ is a student-focused competency intelligence platform designed to help learners understand their current skills, identify competency gaps, measure their progress, and receive personalized learning recommendations.

Unlike traditional assessments that primarily provide marks or grades, CompetencyIQ aims to transform assessment data into meaningful insights that students can actually use to improve their academic, technical, and career readiness.

