🔐 Security Considerations

Because CompetencyIQ may handle student-related information, security is an important part of the system architecture.

Planned security practices include:

Secure authentication
Supabase Row Level Security
Protected database operations
Role-based access control
Secure API interactions
Input validation
Authentication state management
Appropriate protection of student data

Security requirements will be reviewed as the application moves toward production.

